abstract: >-
  Provenance and recalculation of the S7-S11 optical stack wavelength:
  canonical lambda0 = 952,072.1 nm at a 202.600 deg phase lock, replacing
  the deprecated 952,057 nm draft, anchored to math origin 510510 and
  drift baseline 731.
